We make them at least twice every day.
我们每天至少做两次。

231
00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.170
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

232
00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.350
Not a few kinds, like supermarkets.
不像超市那样只有几种。

233
00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.670
Hey, the donuts.
嘿，甜甜圈。

234
00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.370
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

235
00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:20.910
But up to 52 varieties.
而是多达52个品种。

236
00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:21.810
The donuts.
甜甜圈。

237
00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.450
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

238
00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.290
I made the donuts.
我做了甜甜圈。

239
00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.430
Dunkin' Donuts, up to 52 varieties, fresh day and night.
唐恩都乐，多达52个品种，日夜新鲜。

240
00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.050
No supermarket can say that.
没有哪家超市敢这么说。

241
00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.630
So Fred the baker had to make all those donuts, lady.
所以面包师弗雷德得做那么多甜甜圈，女士。

242
00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.270
I have so many questions because I could only hear it and not see it.
我有好多问题，因为我只能听到声音却看不到画面。

243
00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.830
It sounds like he's getting really tired.
听起来他真的很累。

244
00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:40.930
He's tired.
他很累。

245
00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.990
He's making donuts in the rain.
他在雨中做甜甜圈。

246
00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.710
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

247
00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.430
Because he's always making the donuts.
因为他总是在做甜甜圈。

248
00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:53.230
Well, this commercial was named one of the five best commercials of the 80s by the Television
嗯，这则广告被电视广告局评为80年代五大最佳广告之一。

