Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

269
00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.770
Because I know whenever I flew to New York, I got very excited because there was a Dunkin'
因为我知道每次我飞往纽约时，我都会非常兴奋，因为在行李提取处旁边就有一家唐恩都乐。

270
00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.170
Donuts by baggage claim.
甜甜圈店。

271
00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.570
And I would always go get a donut while I waited for my suitcase.
我总会在等行李的时候去买个甜甜圈。

272
00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:29.270
Yeah, we had Dunkin' Donuts in St. Louis growing up, and my dad would go every Sunday.
是啊，我小时候在圣路易斯也有唐恩都乐，我爸爸每周日都会去买。

273
00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.030
And I always wanted the strawberry iced.
我总是想要草莓糖霜口味的。

274
00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.210
I love that one.
我喜欢那个。

275
00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:33.970
That was my favorite.
那是我的最爱。

276
00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:35.050
I love that one, too.
我也喜欢那个。

277
00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:35.570
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

278
00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:41.030
Now, during the office, there was no Dunkin' Donuts on the West CoaSt.
当时，西海岸还没有唐恩都乐。

279
00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:48.950
And John Krasinski had this idea that he wanted to open up the first Dunkin' Donuts in L.A.
约翰·卡拉辛斯基曾有个想法，他想在洛杉矶开设第一家唐恩都乐。

280
00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:50.470
Did he really?
真的吗？

281
00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:50.970
Yes.
是的。

282
00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.910
He was really into this for a while.
他有一段时间真的很热衷于这件事。

283
00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:56.310
And he tried to get Conan O'Brien to go in on it with them.
他还试图拉柯南·奥布莱恩一起入伙。

284
00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.050
Oh, my God.
天哪。

285
00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:57.850
This was a whole thing.
这可是件大事。

286
00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.150
Could you imagine if Conan and John owned a Dunkin' Donuts?
你能想象如果柯南和约翰拥有一家唐恩都乐会怎样吗？

287
00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.110
That was the plan.
那原本是计划好的。

288
00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:08.390
And I don't know why it fell apart or if this was just like a daydream, but he talked about
我不知道为什么后来没成，或者这只是他的一场白日梦，但他一直都在谈论

289
00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.170
it all the time.
这件事。

290
00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:12.610
He wanted to open a Dunkin' Donuts franchise in L.A.
他想在洛杉矶开一家唐恩都乐特许经营店。

291
00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:13.230
And you know what?
你知道吗？

292
00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.230
Now they're here.
现在它们已经开到这儿了。

293
00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:19.590
